268
00:12:52.647 --> 00:12:54.774
Tens de ser mais rápido.

269
00:12:55.358 --> 00:12:56.609
Obrigado.

270
00:12:56.609 --> 00:12:58.028
De nada.

271
00:13:01.781 --> 00:13:03.324
Enfim...

272
00:13:03.366 --> 00:13:05.368
