322
00:14:36.209 --> 00:14:38.169
Espera, Ian, fazemos um dueto.

323
00:14:38.211 --> 00:14:39.754
Que se lixe.
<i>High School Musical?</i>

324
00:14:39.796 --> 00:14:42.090
